<title>JAPAN: Marusan Sec to forgive 1.68 bln yen loans to unit.</title>
<headline>Marusan Sec to forgive 1.68 bln yen loans to unit.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marusan Securities Co Ltd said on Monday that it would forgive 1.68 billion yen worth of loans to its finance unit and would record an extraordinary loss for the same amount in its earnings for fiscal 1996/97.</p>
<p>Marusan said in a statement that, as a result of the move, it would post a parent net profit of 1.7 billion yen for 1996/97 against an actual parent net profit of 2.7 billion yen in 1995/96.</p>
</text>
